╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ expand_exact_steiner_search                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Increase the exact directed-Steiner optimization range so more moderate-fanout broadcasts │
│                          │ use the globally minimum shared multicast tree instead of the greedy fallback. The        │
│                          │ existing subset dynamic program explicitly minimizes unique inter-cloud transfer edges    │
│                          │ and is therefore substantially better at identifying inexpensive relay clouds and shared  │
│                          │ prefixes. Raising the threshold from 11 to 14 terminals keeps the exponential solver      │
│                          │ bounded while making it practical for common multi-region broadcast configurations, where │
