│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ marginal_tree_attachment                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ The greedy multicast-tree construction currently evaluates each new destination path      │
│                          │ using the full link cost, including edges that are already part of the multicast tree.    │
│                          │ This incorrectly penalizes paths that reuse an existing shared trunk, even though a       │
│                          │ broadcast only pays for that trunk once.                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Evaluate attachments on a marginal-cost graph instead: selected tree edges receive zero   │
│                          │ cost while all unselected links retain their transfer cost. The shortest attachment then  │
│                          │ represents only the additional network transfer needed to extend the current broadcast    │
│                          │ topology. This better favors fan-out from already replicated data, reduces redundant      │
│                          │ cross-cloud transfers, and can discover lower-cost shared routes across multiple          │
│                          │ networks.                                                                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0190                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ gpt-5.6-terra                                                                             │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ reasoning                │ {'effort': 'low', 'summary': 'auto'}                                                      │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 13; deleted: 0; modified: 2;                                                       │
