│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The algorithm minimizes physical shared-link cost by selecting a directed multicast edge  │
│                          │ union rather than independently paying for source-to-destination paths. Exact Steiner     │
│                          │ search is used for up to 13 unique destinations, and the greedy implementation evaluates  │
│                          │ multiple initial trunks to avoid poor local attachment order for larger topologies. The   │
│                          │ resulting edge union is pruned, converted into valid source-rooted paths, and replicated  │
│                          │ across all partitions without redundant path computation.                                 │
